      "section_title": "Sector Synthesis & Thesis",
      "content": "India's Power Ancillaries sector is in the midst of a multi-year super-cycle driven by\nrenewable grid transmission expansion and national smart meter replacement (250M units target)\n.\nMarket leaders with technology moats (\nTRIL for EHV Transformers, Genus for Smart Meters, Schneider for Substation Switchgear\n) offer high earnings visibility backed by record order books.",
